  "question": {
    "text": "If three moles of monoatomic gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is mixed with two moles of a diatomic gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, the value of adiabatic exponent <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>γ</mi></math> for the mixture is:",
